<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-8233] KNN and SVM algorithms don&apos;t work when partition doesn&apos;t contain data</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-8233</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;KNN and SVM algorithms implemented with assumption that partition data won&apos;t be null:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;code panel&quot; style=&quot;border-width: 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;codeContent panelContent&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;code-java&quot;&gt;
&lt;span class=&quot;code-keyword&quot;&gt;public&lt;/span&gt; LabeledDataset(&lt;span class=&quot;code-object&quot;&gt;double&lt;/span&gt;[][] mtx, &lt;span class=&quot;code-object&quot;&gt;double&lt;/span&gt;[] lbs, &lt;span class=&quot;code-object&quot;&gt;String&lt;/span&gt;[] featureNames, &lt;span class=&quot;code-object&quot;&gt;boolean&lt;/span&gt; isDistributed) {
        &lt;span class=&quot;code-keyword&quot;&gt;super&lt;/span&gt;();
        &lt;span class=&quot;code-keyword&quot;&gt;assert&lt;/span&gt; mtx != &lt;span class=&quot;code-keyword&quot;&gt;null&lt;/span&gt;;
        &lt;span class=&quot;code-keyword&quot;&gt;assert&lt;/span&gt; lbs != &lt;span class=&quot;code-keyword&quot;&gt;null&lt;/span&gt;;
&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;


&lt;p&gt;Currently it&apos;s wrong assumption, so we need to update dataset to support this assumption or update these algorithms.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
